<title>SWITZERLAND: Baloise bids for rest of Belgian unit.</title>
<headline>Baloise bids for rest of Belgian unit.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss insurer Baloise Holding said it was making a public offer for minority shares in its recently merged Belgian unit Mercator &amp; Noordstar.</p>
<p>Baloise said it held 53 percent in the Belgian insurer, created from the recently completed merger of Baloise subsidiary Mercator with Noordstar.</p>
<p>A Baloise statement said the offer had begun and would run until December 2.</p>
<p>&quot;The price corresponds to the value that the merger was based on,&quot; the statement added.</p>
<p>A Baloise spokesman was not available to elaborate on the price.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
